      "title": "Equation 39",
      "content": "$$E = \\sum_n f_n \\langle \\tilde{\\psi}_n | -\\frac{1}{2} \\nabla^2 | \\tilde{\\psi}_n \\rangle + \\sum_{i,j} \\langle \\tilde{\\psi}_n | \\tilde{p}_i \\rangle G_{ij}^{US} \\langle \\tilde{p}_j | \\tilde{\\psi}_n \\rangle + E_{xc}[\\tilde{n} + \\hat{n} + \\tilde{n}_c] + E_H[\\tilde{n} + \\hat{n}] + \\int v_H[\\tilde{n}_{Zc}] (\\tilde{n}(r) + \\hat{n}(r)) dr + U(R, Z_{ion}), \\quad (33)$$",
